  the dance of the dragons vermax was big  enough to ride so prince jacarys flew  north on his back as a messenger it is  said that vermax didn't like the coal or  snow or ice and became ill-tempered  because of it  this dragon saw battle in the gullet  the first time and died there in his  very first battle along with its rider  in the ensuing fighting  number five vegar this dragon was one of  the three dragons of aegon targaryen the  conqueror ridden by one of his sister  wives visenya  vega then went on to bond with balon  targaryen afterwards and then after  baylon's death vega found another rider  in lady lena velaryon so that's why she  is on this list and when lena wed prince  damon targaryen they flew on their  dragons across the narrow sea to the  free cities including pentas  cohort  lis miss whatever huge crowds came to  see and catch a glimpse of vega and  caraxies the prince daemon's dragon  number six silver wing silverwing was a  silvery she dragon originally of house  targaryen and was first ridden by queen  alison targaryen and later when she died  she did not have any other rider and  then when time went by  a bastard called off white during the  dance of the dragons came up and claimed  the dragon she was considered relatively  docile and friendly towards strangers  like another dragon verma thor which was  her dragon companion silver wing would  change size during the war and fight for  the greens  number 7 verma thor  also called the bronze fury he was a  male dragon first ridden by king  jaehaerys the first targaryen but after  his death he was claimed by a bastard  called hugh hammer  huge hammer  by the time of the dance of the dragons  verma thor was almost 100 years old  which means he was one of the first  generation dragons to be born in  westeros the bronze fury is said to be  the third largest dragon after vegar and  valerion  maybe fourth if we include the cannibal  number 8 sheep stealer this was a male  dragon a wild male dragon during the  dance of the dragons with a taste for  mutton  it lived at the back of dragon mount a  volcano in dragonstone and would hunt  between driftmark and when water  somewhere between the islands sheep  steelers coloring was an ugly mud brown  he was not aggressive towards humans  unless provoked he was one of the three  wild dragons in dragonstone and was  bonded to a bastard girl later on called  nettles during the dance  number nine terrax a young dragon that  was bonded with a female called genera  belarus a member of a valyrian house  that survived the doom  she and the dragon flew southwest to  sotherius a continent in the south which  was as large as essex as she said  so she returned to the valyrian freehold  after three years of traveling having  found only endless jungle deserts and  mountains  number 10 the last the unnamed dragon  not much is really known about this  dragon but what we do know is that it  was bonded with a valyrian dragon lord  called aryan who survived the doom of  valyria and he used the creature to  subjugate and control kohor one of those  cities in esses and he flew south later  on to lay claim to what remained of  valyria to be crowned as the emperor of  valyria and re-established a freehold  along with his 30 000 men from cohort  but then he was never to be seen again  so i hope you have enjoyed watching this  video do hit that like button for  support and subscribe but most of all  smash the bell icon for regular updates  on new videos right here on this channel  till the next one take care fam

